    "section": "Power Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Solar Homing Rocket Launcher\n\nRockets release 8 Homing Cluster Missiles on explosion.\nCluster Missiles deal the same damage type as the Rocket Launcher that fired it. Cluster Damage is unaffected by Rocket Frame.\n\nWhile within 15 metres of allies:\n+50 Handling, +50 Reload Speed, and 0.9x Reload Duration Multiplier.\n\nAfter shooting:\nAllies within 15 metres receive Pack Hunter for 15 seconds, granting them Wolfpack Rounds for Non-Exotic Rocket Launchers.\nPack Hunter persists through stow.\n\n↑More Wolves:\nPassively grants +1 Magazine Size (1 -> 2).\nWolfpack Rounds Kills release an additional faster, homing rocket that deals 126.5% increased damage. \nDamage dealt by the More Wolves rocket is displayed in Yellow Damage Numbers and follows Wolfpack Rounds damage scaling.",
